+- red-namespace_tests.log: 11 tests run, 5 pass and 6 fail. Each failure shows the graph-local error surfacing as `Rejected(...)` where a retryable `Disconnected` was expected, at compose.rs:1668 and :1515. This is the RED the task bead describes: namespace bind mismatch, stale snapshot, explicit config error, host-claim failure, broken intent dir, and cached-client rediscovery. The six names match the fault-injection paths the bead lists.
