+- The logs embed absolute worktree paths; this is cosmetic.
+- The only tier-5 consequence of hg-lnw.24 (production_discovery still asserting Rejected) was a seam break, fixed by hg-lnw.29 in the same branch. That belongs to the seam reviewer.
